          "note": "Read by MacScreenSession: ultra puts a=cmux-rd-encode-profile:ultra in the viewer's cmux.rd offer and the host's cmux-rd serve setup gets \"encode_profile\": \"ultra\"; balanced (the default) sends nothing. Not remote.ultra, which repairs loss on the WireGuard tunnel.",
